  "editor_review": "Stumble Guys offers an exhilarating multiplayer knockout experience that will challenge your abilities and provide endless fun! Competing online with up to 32 players, you must cleverly navigate obstacles, stumble, fall, and confront your rivals across a range of engaging maps, levels, and game modes. Race alongside friends, endure elimination rounds, and collaborate to secure victory. Customize your Stumbler with distinctive emotes, animations, and footprints to flaunt your unique flair. Each month, a new Stumble Pass arrives, loaded with fresh content and rewards to collect. Prepare for an exciting journey through a chaotic race to victory in this thrilling multiplayer battle royale!",
